# Play test of the plan 'The Last Post' (CIPlay plan_last_post, in a test world 'CI ...' set to day 10 first with
# CISetDay 10, for Pneumatic Heights' day:10): a main story in place of Raft's - each stop's frequency comes when the one
# before is done, it is tuned to on the Receiver and played to its end with its own test (the dead letters are carried
# from the first stop); then the sorting barge, sailed to.
plan The Last Post
tune deadletter
include dead_letter_office.play
tune pier
include pillarbox_pier.play
tune jungle
include parcel_canopy.play
tune tubes
include pneumatic_heights.play
tune sorting
include sorting_rock.play
tune telegraph
include telegraph_narrows.play
tune franking
include franking_works.play
tune adas
include adas_round.play
tune gpo
include general_post_office.play
expect blueprints
sail 6
arrive barge
include wandering_sorting_barge.play
plan end
